  message: "META closed by Phase 6 PR3 (commit ea0154e54f). Hash inputs to compute_stable_id and _compute_stable_id extended with name and qualified_name. STABLE_ID_SCHEME bumped v4 → v5. Trade-off documented: stable_id no longer survives renames but distinguishes distinct symbols (per the lab notebook's agreed direction). Self-analysis collision rate 60.2% → 0.8%. Two member items (Phase 6 PR3 residuals on typed-tier factory and linker call_site collisions) tracked in WI-bupim. Needs bakeoff validation."  # 377d
