  message: "Validation failed: the stable_id uniqueness invariant does not hold on a fresh substrate. Member INV-bazij collisions reproduced. A distinct uncovered hash-input mechanism — Python function-local defs omitting the enclosing function from containing_stable_id (analyze/base.py:2333-2338) combined with Python qualified_name=None (WI-fagab) — defeats the name+qualified_name disambiguation that was supposed to close this META. Filed as WI-gitun (P0, parented here). Moving pending_validation -> violated."  # cb0b
