  message: "PRODUCER HALF landed in PR #245 (stable_id v6 atomic bump, ADR-0035 §1/§4/§6): full scope-chain hash (WI-gitun done), §4 path-anchoring on module/interface/type/entry + manifest-path dependency (WI-titiz done), typed-tier mandatory name/qualified_name (WI-zitod done), body_sig dropped, py.py unified onto the shared assemble_stable_id, STABLE_ID_SCHEME v5->v6, occurrence_index slot (=0). Closure gate (ADR-0035 §5) is a closely-following PR2 — NOT yet done: (a) per-file emit-time uniqueness HARD check (error, zero tolerance); (b) whole-corpus collision threshold 5%->~0 with the None-cohort IN the denominator; (c) kind->axis conformance; (d) ratchet test_validation_report_empty baselines down on the v6 collision shrink (deferred from PR1, where the shrink-only gate passed without it); (e) full-corpus re-measure as POSITIVE closure evidence. Keeps awaits_bakeoff_validation. violated -> pending_validation."  # 3fb4
- op: discuss  # e601
  at: '2026-06-16T04:28:53Z'  # e601
  by: agent  # e601
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e601
  clock: 10  # e601
  nonce: e601  # e601
  message: "ADR-0035 §5 VALIDATOR SURFACE landed in PR2 (commit 1350fa06dd, validator-only, no hash change). Behavioral evidence: validate_ir now (a) emits a HARD per-file uniqueness error per colliding (path, stable_id) group, (b) fires the corpus umbrella on ANY collision (threshold 5%->~0) over an all-Symbols denominator with the None-cohort counted+disclosed, (c) always surfaces validation_report.stable_id_stats. §5 kind->axis is satisfied by the pre-existing axis_conformance kind-in-registry check (no new code). Measured: fixture corpus collision-free (ratchet 12->11); SELF-TREE still carries ~35 per-file collision groups (43 corpus-wide / 149 symbols, 0.43%) across SITE families (call_site sql/http, shell export, markdown link [WI-sirid], manifest file) and LOGICAL families (message_queue/graphql stand-ins). These are NOT closed: the per-file check SURFACES them. Closing INV-tazaj requires the v7 producer fix (populate occurrence_index for SITE kinds / dedup LOGICAL stand-ins) + a clean full-corpus re-measure. Stays pending_validation + awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # e601
- op: discuss  # b778
